# Custom challenge objective translations (objectives without Rockstar label IDs).
Beat Blackjack dealers in Rhodes and Van Horn.=在罗兹和范霍恩击败二十一点庄家。
Beat the Five Finger Fillet player in Strawberry, Valentine and Van Horn.=在草莓镇、瓦伦丁和范霍恩击败 Five Finger Fillet 玩家。
Bust a Poker opponent at Flatneck, Saint Denis and Valentine.=在弗莱特奈克、圣丹尼斯和瓦伦丁的扑克游戏中淘汰一名对手。
Catch a Bayou fish from a riverboat and another while on train tracks.=从河船上钓到一条沼泽鱼，并在线路上再钓到一条。
Catch one of every type of fish.=每种鱼都捕获一条。
Double down and win 5 Blackjack hands.=在二十一点中加倍下注并赢得 5 局。
Drag a victim 3,300 feet with your lasso while mounted.=骑马时用套索拖行受害者 3300 英尺。
Hit a target from at least 660 feet with a long-scoped rifle.=使用长瞄准镜步枪击中至少 660 英尺外的目标。
Kill 15 enemies with a long-barrelled shotgun.=使用长枪管霰弹枪击杀 15 名敌人。
Kill 2 animal species in one Dead Eye use.=在一次死亡之眼中击杀 2 种动物。
Kill 5 scavengers while they feed on corpses.=在食腐动物啃食尸体时将其击杀，共 5 只。
Pick and eat 4 different berry species.=采集并食用 4 种不同的浆果。
Pick one of every herb species.=每种草药各采集一株。
Win 3 Blackjack hands with at least 3 hits each.=赢得 3 局二十一点，每局至少再要牌 3 次。
